# Applies to build contexts rooted at THIS repo: audit.sh, middleware/deploy/podman/
# and tests/lab_{qdrant_pipeline,nats_ingress}/docker-compose.yml -- the last two use
# `COPY . .`, so without this they upload target/ and .git/ to the daemon.
# Nothing below is ever COPYed: the images rebuild their own artefacts.
.git
target
**/target
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
**/.pytest_cache
tests/reports

# NOTE: tests/run_tests.sh builds with the PARENT of this repo as its context,
# because every tests/Dockerfile.* COPYs autonomous_dco_rnd/<path>. This file does
# NOT apply there. run_tests.sh writes that context its own .dockerignore on first
# use (deny-all, then re-admit only the trees the Dockerfiles COPY) and aborts only
# if that write fails -- see require_context_ignore() in tests/run_tests.sh.
